WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:01.050
Ryu jumps toward Juri at the shown distance from the right corner.

2
00:00:01.050 --> 00:00:01.650
Crouching heavy scores the forced Punish Counter against airborne Ryu.

3
00:00:01.650 --> 00:00:02.450
Back heavy kick juggles after the launcher.

4
00:00:02.450 --> 00:00:03.450
OD Fuhajin continues the juggle and supplies two Fuha stocks from empty.

5
00:00:03.450 --> 00:00:05.050
OD Saihasho leads into the heavy OD follow-up.

6
00:00:05.050 --> 00:00:05.650
The medium OD follow-up spends the last Drive and puts Juri in burnout.

7
00:00:05.650 --> 00:00:15.050
Normal-health Kaisen Dankairaku catches Ryu after the chained specials.

8
00:00:15.050 --> 00:00:15.650
The Level 3 conversion finishes with Ryu knocked down.
